/images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc16p9x.jpg"}], "slug": "floorball-league-2010--1", "storyline": "Step onto the court and experience the thrill of floorball with Floorball League 2010 (formerly FBL / Floorball League), the first official 3D floorball video game, originally released in 2010. Dive into fast-paced matches with real teams from the International Floorball Federation and the Finnish Salibandyliiga.\n\nWhether you\u2019re a seasoned player or new to the sport, FBL '10 delivers engaging floorball action with dynamic arenas and multiple ways to play.", "summary": "Floorball League 2010 is a 3D floorball simulation game featuring officially licensed floorball teams from the International Floorball Federation (IFF) and the Finnish Salibandyliiga, along with multiple game modes, including exhibition matches, leagues, tournaments, shootouts, and training. Players can compete against computer-controlled opponents or challenge friends in local multiplayer.", "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/floorball-league-2010--1", "videos": [{"id": 203581, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "ZB4a6fUgfe8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZB4a6fUgfe8", "title": "Floorball League - Gameplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZB4a6fUgfe8/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 204512, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "2RUi9mhx4xw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2RUi9mhx4xw", "title": "Floorball League - Powerplay", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/2RUi9mhx4xw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 204513, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "dmnrxgg5N5U", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dmnrxgg5N5U", "title": "Floorball League - Goalie", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/dmnrxgg5N5U/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}